Z||000004||Fformula88||04-01-2001||10:33 AM||||I'm also on the  <A HREF="http://www.probetalk,com" TARGET=_blank>www.probetalk,com</A>  for my 97 Ford Probe.  I use the same screenname on Probetalk as I do here, since it originates from my AOL IM name.  Ironically I haven't taken any heat from it.  Its not nearly as good of a board as this one.  Its broken down into about 25 different forums for every model, trim package, transmission etc etc.  Most of the members are either imature, teenagers, ricers (the Probe has a Mazda drivetrain) or all three.  Its very difficult to actually get useable tech advise.  This board is my favorite!  <P>I've also read the Miata board a little, althought I have never posted.  They seem to be a good group too! <P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
